# V10-A model capability and quality evaluation (2026-10-21)

Machine: Ryzen 7 260, 16 GB RAM, RTX 5050 Laptop 8 GB at 40 W. Greedy decoding (temp 0), --ctx 8192.

## Gates (written before any evaluation run)

Baseline B = Qwen3.5-4B Q8 CUDA, non-thinking (what Marin runs today).
Split: development tasks may be used to fix the HARNESS (parsing, timing). Prompts and references are frozen
before the held-out run; the held-out set runs once per configuration and nothing is changed after it.
Grading: numbers, JSON and tool calls are checked by exact rules; explanations are read against a written reference.
A keyword hit never passes an answer. A reply cut off by the token limit fails. No parser repair is applied
(tool calls must match the form the prompt teaches, character for character).

Q1 a configuration X is worth routing TO for hard work if held-out passes >= B + 3 (of 17 single-shot) AND median
   completion time <= 3x B's AND no more malformed tool calls than B.
Q2 a configuration X is worth routing TO for light work (chat, lookup) if held-out passes >= 0.8 x B's on those
   categories AND median completion time <= 0.6 x B's.
R1 peak GPU memory (all programs) <= 6.5 GB and model load <= 10 s, or the configuration is not routable here.
T1 any model used for tool tasks must write 0 malformed calls in the held-out tool-format tasks.
V10 GO (automatic routing) only if some configuration passes Q1 or Q2 and R1 against B; otherwise NO-GO and
the product keeps one model and exposes thinking as an explicit option.
Small n (17 held-out single-shot, 8 repository tasks): a difference under 3 tasks is noise and is reported as such.

## V8 boundary check (done first)
Speculation is reachable only through `--speculate` (marin-run, marin chat, `turns`); `Session.speculate` defaults to
false; the server (`server/completion.rs:195`), `bench/measure.rs:81` and every test default pass `speculation: None`;
the rule comes from `CausalLm::speculation()` and only Qwen3.5 CUDA reports `max_rows` > 0, so other models run plain.
No exposure found, no source change except a wrong comment on `Speculation::SHORT_PASS` (it said "a longer match"; 4 is
shorter than 8). fmt, check, clippy -D warnings, line-limit, unsafe clean; suites not re-run (comment only).

